SUMMARY:Veterans Appreciation Day at Santa Rosa County Libraries
DESCRIPTION:Santa Rosa County's Veterans Services and its libraries invite
  veterans to drop in at any branch for refreshments on Friday afternoon. 
 The Friends of the Library groups provide the food. The Gulf Breeze\, Jay
 \, Milton\, Navarre and Pace branches all take part.\nPrice: Free\nArea: 
 Gulf Breeze & Navarre\nTimes: Friday 11/6 · 12:30 PM to 3:30 PM\nChecked
